e dashed lines descend to three lower-level nodes, each representing a spec=
ific application.  The leftmost node is a rounded rectangle labeled 'Cycle =
Detection - `Linked List Loop`', indicating its use in detecting cycles wit=
hin linked lists. The rightmost node is a similarly styled rounded rectangl=
